; A synthetic ledger shaped like a real one imported from GnuCash: every account opened on the day of
; the import with its GnuCash name as metadata, budget flags on the cash, card and loan accounts only
; (every expense is a budgeted category), opening balances, a paycheck split thirteen ways, and the
; month's envelope assignments in the year file. The accounts, amounts and payees are invented.
option "title" "GnuCash import"
option "operating_currency" "USD"

include "2026.beancount"

2026-10-01 open Assets:Current-Assets:Wallet USD
  budget: "on"
  gnucash: "Wallet"

2026-10-01 open Assets:Current-Assets:Checking USD
  budget: "on"
  gnucash: "Checking"

